  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Vendify is one of the most trusted Vending Machine Manufacturers in the US.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">What separates us from vending manufacturers?&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are priced at half price compared to the competition.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We have high tech machines that are connected to our cloud system to monitor inventory and update prices making it easy to manage.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Rated as the best support for vending machines. We focus on customer care which in turn separates us from other companies.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are beginner friendly and we have a detecated team to help start the machine and set it up as the client needs.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">What's in it for you?&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Get 10% of total order revenue on high price items. You can make minimum $400 on each order if the customer purchased one unit of the cheapest machine we have.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Easy sell. Our machines are very easy to sell because they are priced so low compared to the competition.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Get our help with any material or get any of your questions answered very fast to help you sell the machines.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Don't hesitate to reach out to contact@vendifyusa.com with any questions!&nbsp;</p>",
